WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.570
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:03.840 --> 00:08.430
Go Taewoon, Kim Dohyun

3
00:20.270 --> 00:24.900
Baek Seunghoon, Lee Kyungwon

4
00:35.910 --> 00:43.880
Twisted Tie

5
00:43.880 --> 00:47.170
Episode 3. A Dangerous Bet

6
01:17.080 --> 01:20.960
I brought the additional order list you request...

7
01:28.050 --> 01:30.720
What are you... right now...

8
01:39.060 --> 01:40.430
You.

9
01:42.600 --> 01:44.440
What are you doing...

10
02:05.210 --> 02:10.210
Are you going to just stand there? You're interrupting the flow of the meeting.

11
02:11.760 --> 02:18.640
Mr. Lee, distribute the materials and take a seat.

12
02:44.079 --> 02:48.040
Wow, your hands are incredibly hot.

13
02:48.420 --> 02:50.130
Do you work out?

14
02:51.210 --> 02:53.800
You've got quite a useful build.

15
02:55.340 --> 02:57.640
Let go of me, will you?

16
03:00.930 --> 03:02.890
Mr. Baek.

17
03:04.640 --> 03:09.190
That's enough messing with my employee, we don't have time.

18
03:10.980 --> 03:12.780
Too bad.

19
03:18.990 --> 03:23.040
Team Leader Kang, you look like you wouldn't bleed a drop if pricked,

20
03:23.040 --> 03:28.079
but I really like how hot-blooded your subordinate is.

21
03:29.000 --> 03:32.590
Did you say his name was Lee Sunwoo?

22
03:32.590 --> 03:35.590
Let's grab a meal together sometime.

23
03:48.650 --> 03:56.530
Now, shall we see what our amazing Team Leader Kang has prepared for us?

24
04:08.210 --> 04:10.790
Please look at the screen.

25
04:14.250 --> 04:21.050
The main concept for this VVIP lounge is secrecy, and...

26
04:21.050 --> 04:23.680
the most important thing

27
04:27.600 --> 04:30.140
is securing privacy.

28
04:30.140 --> 04:33.440
We've completely separated it into three branches.

29
04:41.909 --> 04:45.540
[VIP Lounge Interior Design and Material Supply Contract]

30
04:45.540 --> 04:53.000
Let's sign the contract, we've accommodated Mr. Baek's requested revisions as much as possible.

31
04:53.000 --> 04:57.710
I believe we've met the contract conditions sufficiently enough with this.

32
04:57.710 --> 04:59.880
I know, right.

33
05:01.470 --> 05:04.600
These numerical conditions are perfect, but...

34
05:06.350 --> 05:08.100
Hmm...

35
05:09.430 --> 05:11.520
My heart?

36
05:12.850 --> 05:16.020
My heart just isn't entirely moved yet.

37
05:27.160 --> 05:29.040
Team Leader Kang.

38
05:30.000 --> 05:35.460
About that newbie from earlier. Was his name Lee Sunwoo?

39
05:35.460 --> 05:38.000
He's the youngest on our team.

40
05:39.090 --> 05:43.260
- Please refrain from non-work-related questions. - Oh, come on, Team Leader Kang.

41
05:44.010 --> 05:48.470
Don't be so on edge. Who says I'm going to eat him?

42
05:49.430 --> 05:54.810
It's just... his eyes...

43
05:57.860 --> 06:00.190
were quite amusing.

44
06:03.400 --> 06:06.820
He follows his master so blindly.

45
06:07.120 --> 06:14.620
Strangely, only when you look away, his gaze gets incredibly lustful.

46
06:14.620 --> 06:17.460
What are you trying to say?

47
06:17.460 --> 06:22.970
No, why... just like a dog off its leash.

48
06:22.970 --> 06:26.840
He looks like he wants to pounce and tear into you any second,

49
06:26.840 --> 06:32.270
but feels like he's forcing his tail between his legs because he's scared of his master?

50
06:33.390 --> 06:39.650
- Well, guys like that are beasts in bed. - You're crossing the line, Mr. Baek.

51
06:42.360 --> 06:46.659
If you continue like this, this contract...

52
06:47.159 --> 06:51.950
- We will reconsider it. - Hey, what do you mean reconsider?

53
06:52.659 --> 06:54.710
Dojin.

54
06:54.710 --> 07:01.340
Rumor has it all over our industry that your position as Team Leader is in danger if this project doesn't succeed?

55
07:03.800 --> 07:07.050
Let me spend just one night with that newbie.

56
07:09.550 --> 07:14.100
- What crazy nonsense are you spouting right now? - Crazy nonsense?

57
07:14.730 --> 07:16.770
That hurts.

58
07:17.520 --> 07:20.690
I'm proposing a very reasonable business deal.

59
07:23.990 --> 07:26.780
Let him spend one night with me.

60
07:26.780 --> 07:31.740
Then I'll stamp this contract right now on my end and get it done with.

61
07:34.540 --> 07:40.540
Our Team Leader Kang secures his performance and keeps his position, and I get to play with a toy I want for a day.

62
07:40.540 --> 07:42.920
Isn't it a win-win?

63
07:42.920 --> 07:44.630
You...

64
07:45.380 --> 07:47.300
are out of your mind.

65
07:48.840 --> 07:52.680
Why are you making such a scary face again?

66
07:52.680 --> 07:56.810
Aren't you Team Leader Kang, who strictly separates personal and professional life?

67
07:56.810 --> 08:02.610
Sending out a mere new employee to entertain for one night... What's so hard about that compared to your performance record?

68
08:05.030 --> 08:07.610
Or...

69
08:07.610 --> 08:10.110
Are you hiding something?

70
08:11.530 --> 08:18.580
Some very personal reason... why he shouldn't be in another man's arms?

71
08:20.210 --> 08:23.000
I'll give you until next week.

72
08:25.500 --> 08:30.640
Whether you hand over Mr. Lee and secure the signed contract,

73
08:30.640 --> 08:36.100
or protect a mere newbie and go back empty-handed...

74
08:36.100 --> 08:39.390
You make the decision, Team Leader Kang.

75
09:43.960 --> 09:46.540
The place that bastard touched earlier...

76
09:49.880 --> 09:51.720
Is it here?

77
09:52.090 --> 09:53.840
Sunwoo...

78
10:02.480 --> 10:04.810
Ah, it hurts... hold on.

79
10:07.570 --> 10:08.980
Stop.

80
10:08.980 --> 10:10.440
Ah.

81
10:11.490 --> 10:15.700
Ah, ah it hurts, ah hold on, Sunwoo...

82
10:30.050 --> 10:32.010
Ah... Sunwoo, hold on.

83
10:37.300 --> 10:40.810
I know your life depends on this contract, Mr. Kang,

84
10:41.310 --> 10:47.900
so even when that bastard was touching your body, I forced myself not to snap...

85
10:50.190 --> 10:52.610
I can't hold back a second time.

86
10:52.610 --> 10:55.780
I really might kill him.

87
10:59.530 --> 11:01.910
Kill who?

88
11:02.950 --> 11:05.330
Stop saying useless things and...

89
11:06.120 --> 11:09.170
Erase it, all of it.

90
11:10.670 --> 11:13.210
Cover it up with yours.

91
12:56.320 --> 13:01.450
Ah, hold on Ah, slowly, it's too deep...

92
14:58.730 --> 15:04.990
- You're seriously just ignorantly strong. - Ah, I'm sorry. Did it hurt?

93
15:04.990 --> 15:08.240
Ah... I gripped you too tightly...

94
15:08.240 --> 15:12.490
I don't know if I'll even be able to go to work properly tomorrow...

95
15:12.490 --> 15:15.160
It feels like my whole body is going to shatter...

96
15:15.870 --> 15:19.540
Should I apply some medicine? Or I could massage...

97
15:19.540 --> 15:21.670
It's fine...

98
15:21.670 --> 15:24.800
Just stay still, I'm dizzy...

99
15:35.430 --> 15:38.940
Earlier, watching you with Mr. Baek...

100
15:38.940 --> 15:42.570
It felt like there was a fire burning inside me.

101
15:43.190 --> 15:47.610
- I know I shouldn't act like that, but... - If you know, keep it in moderation.

102
15:48.700 --> 15:50.870
I'm Kang Dojin...

103
15:52.580 --> 15:57.210
Do I look like such a pushover that I can't handle one guy like him?

104
15:58.540 --> 16:02.750
No... I know you're perfect, Mr. Kang. But...

105
16:03.960 --> 16:09.300
I still hate it. Anyone laying a single fingertip on you.

106
16:11.180 --> 16:13.470
I hated it too.

107
16:14.260 --> 16:15.680
What?

108
16:17.890 --> 16:20.770
Others touching my body...

109
16:22.360 --> 16:24.320
I loathe it.

110
16:26.440 --> 16:29.450
Earlier, when his hand touched me...

111
16:31.870 --> 16:35.620
It felt so filthy I wanted to wash it off immediately.

112
16:42.920 --> 16:47.460
But you didn't feel filthy. Strangely...

113
16:49.130 --> 16:51.640
It's been like that since the beginning...

114
16:53.430 --> 16:55.390
Mr. Kang...

115
16:57.180 --> 17:00.600
So stop making such a stupid face.

116
17:00.600 --> 17:04.359
Someone might think you forced yourself on me.

117
17:06.819 --> 17:12.200
Do I look like the kind of person who gives up this bed... to just anyone?

118
17:18.579 --> 17:23.040
What you just said... for the rest of my life...

119
17:24.079 --> 17:26.750
I won't forget it.

120
17:29.920 --> 17:34.720
Be quiet... stop making me talk and just hold me... I'm tired.

121
17:36.260 --> 17:38.930
Yes, understood.

122
18:57.720 --> 19:00.470
Woojae, right there, just a little more...

123
19:20.330 --> 19:26.420
Twisted Tie
